    "updated_at": "2022-03-02T10:07:36Z",
    "body": "I agree with the byte stream, that definitively would be great. I didn't take that concept into consideration when opening this issue, and as such I guess this issue is redundant.\r\nOne reason for `LineStream` to be `Uint8array` based was to align with a utility we have that does the equivalent but with Deno's `Deno.Reader` & `Deno.Writer`: so to have a 1-to-1 mapping & people effortlessly change over to the WHATWG streams based one; but looking back on it with this issue in mind, I see that might have been a mistake.",
